22:["$","$L3a",null,{"faqs":[{"question":"What are data analytics services (and is this courses or consulting)?","answer":"Consulting and delivery — not courses. We're a data analytics agency and engineering team: we build and run your data — pipelines and a warehouse (data engineering), BI dashboards, analytics, and AI/predictive models. You get working analytics tied to real decisions, and you own all of it. We can also train your team along the way."},{"question":"Data analytics vs business intelligence vs data science?","answer":"BI tells you what happened (dashboards, reports). Data analytics digs into why and what's next. Data science builds predictive models and AI. They build on each other, and we deliver the whole ladder — from clean data to AI insight."},{"question":"What is agentic analytics / AI data analytics?","answer":"We connect AI agents to your data, under your company's umbrella — your tools, your security. They continuously watch your business and generate reports and alerts on the thousand things that can happen (trends, anomalies, forecasts, risks) in plain language, on demand or on a schedule — no analyst bottleneck."},{"question":"How much do data analytics services cost?","answer":"It depends on scope and your data. We work three ways: Agentic Analytics (a monthly productized service), a fixed-scope project priced up front, or a dedicated nearshore data team from $50 USD/hour. Senior nearshore talent costs a fraction of a Big-4 engagement — and you own everything we build."},{"question":"Do I own my data, warehouse, and dashboards?","answer":"Yes — always. Your data, warehouse, pipelines, dashboards, and models are yours, built on your cloud. No lock-in to a black-box platform; you can run it, extend it, or take it anywhere."},{"question":"Do you do analytics for my industry (healthcare, finance, retail)?","answer":"Yes. We have domain expertise across healthcare (HIPAA-aware), finance and fintech, retail and ecommerce, logistics, and manufacturing. Industry-aware analytics respects your sector's data, rules, and the decisions that actually matter."}],"id":"faq","title":"What teams ask before starting with data.","fill":true}]
23:["$","section",null,{"data-reveal":true,"className":"border-b-hairline-soft py-20","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Related services"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 font-display text-display-m font-bold text-fg","children":"Often paired with data & analytics"}],["$","ul",null,{"data-reveal-stagger":true,"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4","children":[["$","li","custom-software-development",{"children":"$L3b"}],["$","li","ai-agent-development",{"children":"$L3c"}],["$","li","cloud-migration",{"children":"$L3d"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-20 font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Learn more"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 font-display text-display-m font-bold text-fg","children":"From the blog"}],["$","$L3e",null,{"posts":[{"title":"AI in data analytics: what's real in 2026","slug":"ai-in-data-analytics","category":"AI","excerpt":"AI in data analytics is real where it does narrow, repeatable work — forecasting, anomaly detection, and natural-language querying on top of clean data. Here's what actually ships in 2026, what's still hype, and how to add it without rebuilding your stack.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/ai-in-data-hybrid.webp","imageAlt":"A data team with AI tools like ChatGPT and Claude, illustrating AI in data analytics"},{"title":"How much do data analytics services cost? (2026)","slug":"data-analytics-services-cost","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Data analytics services cost anywhere from a few thousand dollars for a single dashboard to six figures for an end-to-end data platform. Here's what drives the price, what each engagement type costs, and how nearshore changes the math.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/data-cost.webp","imageAlt":"A data dashboard with stacked coins, representing data analytics services cost"},{"title":"Data analytics vs BI vs data science: what's the difference?","slug":"data-analytics-vs-bi-vs-data-science","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Data analytics vs business intelligence vs data science — three terms that get used interchangeably and shouldn't. Here's what each one actually does, when you need which, and how they stack into one data capability.","readMin":6,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/data-vs-science.webp","imageAlt":"A data scientist at multiple monitors, comparing data analytics vs BI vs data science"},{"title":"Data engineering vs data analytics: the difference","slug":"data-engineering-vs-data-analytics","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Data engineering builds the pipelines and warehouse; data analytics turns that data into decisions. Here's the real data engineering vs data analytics difference — what each role does, the tools, and which one you need first.","readMin":5,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/data-engineering.webp","imageAlt":"A data engineer at infrastructure, illustrating data engineering vs data analytics"},{"title":"Healthcare data analytics: turning patient data into outcomes","slug":"healthcare-data-analytics","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Healthcare data analytics turns scattered patient data — EHRs, claims, devices, labs — into decisions that improve outcomes, lower cost, and run cleanly. Here's what it covers, what it costs, and how to ship it without the data swamp.","readMin":5,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/data-healthcare.webp","imageAlt":"A doctor reviewing a health data dashboard, healthcare data analytics"},{"title":"What is data analytics? (for business — and what it costs)","slug":"what-is-data-analytics","category":"Guide","excerpt":"What is data analytics? For a business, it's turning raw data into decisions you can act on — pipelines, dashboards, and insights that drive action. Here's how it works, the maturity ladder, and what data analytics services cost.","readMin":5,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/data-what-is.webp","imageAlt":"A data analyst studying a dashboard, illustrating what data analytics is"}],"className":"mt-8"}]]}]
